@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
skinparam backgroundColor #0D1525
skinparam defaultFontColor #EDF4FF
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #91AED1
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #1A2940
skinparam activityBorderColor #91AED1
skinparam activityDiamondBackgroundColor #4A302B
skinparam activityDiamondBorderColor #F1AD8A
skinparam activityStartColor #60C7E5
skinparam activityEndColor #60C7E5
skinparam wrapWidth 190
skinparam maxMessageSize 180

title CF-M05 — Manual application preparation or progress recording
start
:CF-M05-S01\nInitiating actor\nApplicant prepares an application\nor explicitly updates progress.;
if (CF-M05-S02\nCurrent actor can access intended\napplication and selected resources?) then (yes)
if (CF-M05-S03\nRequest is a preparation edit?) then (yes)
:CF-M05-S04\nApplicant\nIdentify company/opportunity and\nselected resume; write own letter;
:CF-M05-S05\nSystem\nValidate intended draft under\napplicable incomplete-draft rules;
if (CF-M05-S06\nPreparation edit valid under\ncurrent applicable rules?) then (yes)
:CF-M05-S07\nSystem\nSave permitted preparation;
:CF-M05-S08\nSystem\nUse CF-M17 to classify actual\nresult; return only evidence-\nsupported effect;
stop
else (no)
:CF-M05-S09\nSystem\nReport invalid preparation without\nclaiming saved change;
stop
endif
else (no)
:CF-M05-S10\nApplicant\nExplicitly identify actual\nprogress event and intended\ntransition;
if (CF-M05-S11\nTransition/correction permitted\nfor current context?) then (yes)
:CF-M05-S12\nSystem\nRecord progress with\ndistinguishable event/history\ncontext;
if (CF-M05-S13\nActual material capture also\nrequested?) then (yes)
:CF-M05-S14\nSystem\nContinue separate CF-M06; status\nalone does not prove capture or\nexternal receipt;
stop
else (no)
:CF-M05-S15\nSystem\nUse CF-M17 to classify actual\nresult; return only evidence-\nsupported effect;
stop
endif
else (no)
:CF-M05-S16\nSystem\nReport denied or invalid\ntransition; do not infer progress\nfrom email/calendar;
stop
endif
endif
else (no)
:CF-M05-S17\nSystem\nDeny before prohibited effect or\nprotected disclosure; report unmet\ngate;
stop
endif
legend bottom
A: accepted profile core only. Other policy detail: P / proposed refinement.
Step IDs identify full descriptions in the activity view.
Logical ordering; no atomicity, runtime, timing or execution proof.
endlegend
@enduml
